    "title": "Start With The Retirement Party - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Frank Ramos ,\n12 hours ago A legal career, told backward, from leaving at the top to learning where to begin. Imagine a lawyer at her retirement party. She has tried her last case, packed her office, and heard enough speeches. Then a partner she hired out of law school leans over and says, “We’ve got it from here.” Those are the words she will remember. The partner means the clients, the cases, the associates, and the problems that will arrive Monday morning. She looks around the room and believes him. Read full article",
